{
  "slug": "mcp-server-guide",
  "name": "Mcp Server Guide",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Build apps, clone websites, and implement Figma designs through Anima Playground. Describe what you want, paste a website URL, or drop in a Figma link. Anima handles design, code generation, database, and hosting. Publish to a live URL. Crate in parallel variant creation for rapid prototyping.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **1 skill**, `anima` (Build and ship web apps on Agent Grid — a governed hub where AI agents create, host, publish,…) and **1 MCP server**, `anima`.\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install mcp-server-guide@claude-community` from `AnimaApp/mcp-server-guide`.",
